# But it triggers Bash!
# So the priority: Bash ("#!...") > R ("#...")

# Let me understand the full priority for "#":
# "#!" at line start -> Bash
# "#include " (with space) at line start -> C++
# "#" at line start (other) -> R

# But then there are higher-priority patterns that override R:
# import -> Python (higher than R)
# println( -> Julia (higher than R)
# etc.

